{
    "title": "Korean Air My",
    "description": "\u25a0 Korean Air My is now available on Wear OS. \r\n\u2022 Service supported in Wear OS Device:\r\n  - Mobile Boarding Pass\r\n  - View SKYPASS Membership Card \r\n\r\n\u203b Korean Air My on Wear OS needs to be synced with the mobile app.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Features\r\n- Booking, check-in, and ticketing\r\n- Personalized travel info per itinerary\r\n- View the cabin of your aircraft with the 360\u00b0 VR experience\r\n- Real-time flight info via the app's push notification\r\n- View baggage load status\r\n- Login by using PIN number or biometric authentication\r\n- Confirm boarding pass and SKYPASS card offline\r\n\r\nWe recommend that you upgrade to the latest version of Korean Air\u2019s app for the newest features and fixes. Compatibility: Requires Android 5.0.0(21) (Lolipop) or later.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u25a0 Korean Air My is now available on Wear OS. <br>\u2022 Service supported in Wear OS Device:<br>  - Mobile Boarding Pass<br>  - View SKYPASS Membership Card <br><br>\u203b Korean Air My on Wear OS needs to be synced with the mobile app.<br><br>\u25a0 Features<br>- Booking, check-in, and ticketing<br>- Personalized travel info per itinerary<br>- View the cabin of your aircraft with the 360\u00b0 VR experience<br>- Real-time flight info via the app&#39;s push notification<br>- View baggage load status<br>- Login by using PIN number or biometric authentication<br>- Confirm boarding pass and SKYPASS card offline<br><br>We recommend that you upgrade to the latest version of Korean Air\u2019s app for the newest features and fixes. Compatibility: Requires Android 5.0.0(21) (Lolipop) or later.",
